2. Word list (words.js)

   The word list in words.js is derived from a Turkish word frequency list
   created by Hermit Dave (https://invokeit.wordpress.com/frequency-word-lists/),
   based on subtitles from opensubtitles.org, which is licensed under the
   Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 license
   (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/).

   The translations in words.js were revised, corrected and extended by
   Zilvinas S, who also added 500 everyday words to the list. As required by
   the original license, the whole of words.js — including the added words —
   is distributed under the same Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
   license, not under section 1. Anyone reusing it must credit both Hermit
   Dave (original list) and Zilvinas S (revised translations and added words).

